          "confidence": 0.95
        },
        {
          "beat_type": "tonal relief / dark humor",
          "description": "The exchange about the antenna ('It only tried to kill me once') and June's deadpan response ('Tonight we don't have time for a second opinion') pairs genuine danger with dry banter, undercutting urgency with gallows humor.",
          "approximate_location": "middle",
          "confidence": 0.9
        },
        {
          "beat_type": "obstacle / complication",
