        {
          "beat_type": "payoff / comic relief",
          "description": "Comet is found under a vending machine in the band room — muddy and sleepy. Kell's observation ('Smart dog. Dry floor, free snacks.') delivers the missing-dog subplot's resolution as a light, earned joke.",
          "approximate_location": "early-middle",
          "confidence": 0.93
