          "beat_type": "thematic statement",
          "description": "June's morning bulletin — reporting the open road, stocked shelter, and recovered dog 'with zero remorse' — weaves the practical and the personal into a single broadcast, embodying the station's role as community anchor.",
          "approximate_location": "middle",
          "confidence": 0.92
