        {
          "beat_type": "tonal beat / music as meaning",
          "description": "Noah cues a brass-heavy cassette and the room 'brightens with music.' The music is not incidental — it marks a collective emotional exhale. June's distinction ('Once is joy. Twice is branding.') uses wit to protect the moment's sincerity.",
