        {
          "beat_type": "closing image / thematic resolution",
          "description": "The ON AIR sign steadies into a solid red glow — contrasting with its flicker and failure in scene one — as the team settles back to work. The image closes the arc: the station is live, the community is connected, and the work continues.",
